{
  "id": "project-records",
  "title": {
    "zh": "横向项目",
    "en": "Project"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "整理横向项目：需求摘要、个人负责事项、交付物与版本、沟通结论、验收节点、待确认问题、关联会议 / 行动项 / 稿件与项目材料。默认模板不收合同金额与其他敏感业务细节；事项与节点状态由用户维护，不判断合同履约，审批与经费另行决定。",
    "en": "Organises a sponsored project: brief, your own tasks, deliverables with versions, communication conclusions, acceptance milestones, open questions, linked meetings / actions / manuscripts and project materials. The default template stores no contract amounts or other sensitive business details; you maintain task and milestone status, contract acceptance is not judged, and approval and budget are handled elsewhere."
  },
  "author": "dsh-scholar-board",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "sizes": [
    "m",
    "l"
  ],
  "source": "widget-board:records",
  "capabilities": [
    "widget-board:records.read",
    "widget-board:records.write",
    "widget-board:records.draft"
  ],
  "defaultBox": {
    "w": 2,
    "h": 30
  },
  "minBox": {
    "w": 1,
    "h": 16
  },
  "scripts": [
    "project-model.js",
    "copy.js",
    "view.js",
    "rows.js",
    "editor.js"
  ],
  "props": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 80
      },
      "kicker": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 40
      }
    }
  },
  "data": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "records": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 200,
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "quota": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "total": {
        "type": "number"
      },
      "truncated": {
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    }
  },
